[
 {
  "t": "00:00:00",
  "text": "Hey everyone, I'm Guy."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:00:00",
  "text": "A lot of fitness beginners have been asking—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:00:02",
  "text": "They don’t know how to plan their workouts at the gym."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:00:04",
  "text": "And they ask me—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:00:05",
  "text": "If you're training your whole body using machines only,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:00:07",
  "text": "how should you structure your workout routine?"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:00:09",
  "text": "So today I’ve put together"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:00:10",
  "text": "a full-body machine workout split across 4 days."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:00:12",
  "text": "Just 13 exercises in total."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:00:13",
  "text": "Super simple."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:00:14",
  "text": "Very forgiving."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:00:15",
  "text": "It’ll definitely make you fall in love with training."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:00:17",
  "text": "These 13 exercises"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:00:19",
  "text": "are just a general framework."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:00:20",
  "text": "As you progress over time,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:00:21",
  "text": "you’ll gradually increase the weight."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:00:23",
  "text": "Just focus on mastering these 13 moves,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:00:24",
  "text": "and you’ll see major improvements."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:00:26",
  "text": "The four days are split into:"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:00:27",
  "text": "Chest,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:00:28",
  "text": "Legs,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:00:28",
  "text": "Shoulders,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:00:29",
  "text": "Back."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:00:30",
  "text": "Chest day:"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:00:31",
  "text": "Chest press, chest fly, reverse fly, bicep curl."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:00:34",
  "text": "Leg day:"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:00:35",
  "text": "Leg press, leg curl, knee extension."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:00:38",
  "text": "Shoulder day:"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:00:39",
  "text": "Shoulder press, lateral raise, tricep pushdown."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:00:42",
  "text": "Back day:"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:00:43",
  "text": "Lat pulldown (overhand), lat pulldown (underhand), seated row."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:00:46",
  "text": "You can screenshot this chart first,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:00:48",
  "text": "and record your training weights on it each time."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:00:50",
  "text": "Track whether your training intensity is improving."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:00:54",
  "text": "In the full demo video,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:00:55",
  "text": "I’ll show you my current physique,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:00:57",
  "text": "and the actual weights and tempo I use when training."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:00:59",
  "text": "Just for your reference."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:01:01",
  "text": "First exercise:"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:01:02",
  "text": "Chest press."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:01:03",
  "text": "Here’s the idea—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:01:04",
  "text": "Weight and muscle mass are closely related."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:01:06",
  "text": "So for each training day,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:01:07",
  "text": "we always start with"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:01:09",
  "text": "a heavier, higher-intensity movement."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:01:11",
  "text": "For chest press, you’re basically choosing between two machines:"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:01:14",
  "text": "Seated chest press or Smith bench press."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:01:16",
  "text": "Today I’m demonstrating the seated chest press."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:01:18",
  "text": "The benefit is—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:01:19",
  "text": "It’s easy to use."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:01:20",
  "text": "Very forgiving."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:01:21",
  "text": "When you sit down,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:01:22",
  "text": "don’t rush to start pushing."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:01:23",
  "text": "First, adjust the seat height properly."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:01:26",
  "text": "Then adjust the range of motion."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:01:29",
  "text": "Start with a light weight to warm up."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:01:35",
  "text": "During the warm-up,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:01:37",
  "text": "check your own posture."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:01:39",
  "text": "Is the seat too low, causing your shoulders to shrug?"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:01:41",
  "text": "Are your elbows flaring out too much, causing shoulder impingement?"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:01:43",
  "text": "When doing the seated chest press, you don’t need to retract your shoulder blades."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:01:47",
  "text": "Just keep your shoulders down and relaxed."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:01:48",
  "text": "I only retract and depress my shoulder blades,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:01:50",
  "text": "and arch my back slightly when I’m training for powerlifting."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:01:53",
  "text": "That way, more back muscles can help support heavier loads."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:01:56",
  "text": "But when I’m training for hypertrophy,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:01:58",
  "text": "I just keep my shoulders relaxed and down."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:01:59",
  "text": "Focus on isolating the target muscles."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:02:01",
  "text": "For this exercise, my working sets are"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:02:03",
  "text": "72.5 kg, 12 reps, 3 sets."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:02:05",
  "text": "Rest 90 seconds between sets."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:02:06",
  "text": "Watch my training tempo—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:02:08",
  "text": "Slow press, pause, slow release."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:02:11",
  "text": "And I don’t go all the way down."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:02:13",
  "text": "If you go all the way down,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:02:13",
  "text": "it means you have to restart the movement each rep."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:02:16",
  "text": "It’s not that it’s wrong—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:02:17",
  "text": "But today’s goal is"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:02:19",
  "text": "to focus on muscle activation and physique sculpting."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:02:22",
  "text": "Second exercise: pec deck fly."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:02:24",
  "text": "Same idea—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:02:25",
  "text": "Super simple and very forgiving."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:02:27",
  "text": "Again, after sitting down,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:02:28",
  "text": "don’t rush to start."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:02:29",
  "text": "First, adjust the seat height."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:02:32",
  "text": "Then adjust the handles."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:02:36",
  "text": "Start with a moderate weight to warm up."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:02:46",
  "text": "Every exercise after this is the same—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:02:48",
  "text": "Adjust everything before you start training."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:02:50",
  "text": "I won’t explain it verbally each time."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:02:52",
  "text": "For this exercise, my working sets are"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:02:53",
  "text": "65 kg, 12 reps, 3 sets."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:02:55",
  "text": "Rest 90 seconds between sets."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:02:57",
  "text": "Training tempo: slow squeeze, pause, slow release."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:03:00",
  "text": "The goal of this exercise is"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:03:02",
  "text": "to isolate the inner portion of the pectoralis major."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:03:05",
  "text": "It helps with chest hypertrophy,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:03:07",
  "text": "and improves chest muscle contraction and mind-muscle connection."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:03:10",
  "text": "Great for practicing control and feeling chest activation."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:03:14",
  "text": "Third exercise: reverse fly."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:03:16",
  "text": "This targets..."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:03:17",
  "text": "the rear delts."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:03:19",
  "text": "You might be thinking—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:03:20",
  "text": "Huh, that’s odd."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:03:20",
  "text": "Isn’t rear delts training supposed to be on shoulder day?"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:03:23",
  "text": "That’s because the day after our shoulder day is what?"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:03:25",
  "text": "Back day, right?"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:03:26",
  "text": "And the movements on back day—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:03:27",
  "text": "they all require rear delt involvement."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:03:29",
  "text": "To avoid affecting the quality of back day training,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:03:31",
  "text": "I place rear delt exercises"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:03:33",
  "text": "on chest day instead."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:03:35",
  "text": "After pec fly,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:03:36",
  "text": "you can use the same machine"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:03:38",
  "text": "to train rear delts."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:03:40",
  "text": "It’s just so convenient."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:03:41",
  "text": "Start with a light warm-up set"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:03:43",
  "text": "to find rear delt activation."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:03:45",
  "text": "Key point of the movement—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:03:47",
  "text": "don’t intentionally retract your scapula."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:03:49",
  "text": "That’ll shift the working area"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:03:51",
  "text": "to the mid-lower traps."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:03:52",
  "text": "Of course, that’s also a training method."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:03:55",
  "text": "But if you want the load"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:03:56",
  "text": "to really hit the rear delts—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:03:58",
  "text": "then we"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:03:58",
  "text": "keep the scapula stable, no intentional movement."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:04:01",
  "text": "Let’s feel it with just bodyweight."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:04:02",
  "text": "Extend both arms forward."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:04:04",
  "text": "Palms facing down."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:04:05",
  "text": "This is retraction."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:04:07",
  "text": "This is protraction."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:04:09",
  "text": "Retraction."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:04:11",
  "text": "Protraction."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:04:13",
  "text": "We stay in the protracted position."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:04:18",
  "text": "If your scapula is retracted,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:04:20",
  "text": "your arms can open past 180 degrees."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:04:24",
  "text": "But when protracted,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:04:27",
  "text": "you’ll hit a block around 160."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:04:29",
  "text": "And that’s the range of motion we want to train."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:04:32",
  "text": "Feel it—let the rear delts take the load."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:04:35",
  "text": "That’s the range we’re targeting."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:04:38",
  "text": "Arms extended forward."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:04:40",
  "text": "Move your arms outward in a circular motion—not retracting."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:04:42",
  "text": "Training tempo: slow open, pause, slow release."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:04:46",
  "text": "My working sets for this movement—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:04:48",
  "text": "31.5 kg, 12 reps, 3 sets."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:04:50",
  "text": "Rest 90 seconds between sets."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:04:52",
  "text": "Many people, when training this movement,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:04:53",
  "text": "focus too much on the weight,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:04:55",
  "text": "causing too much back muscle involvement—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:04:57",
  "text": "and failing to isolate the rear delts properly."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:05:00",
  "text": "Rear delts aren’t a large muscle group."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:05:02",
  "text": "We need to use appropriate weight"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:05:04",
  "text": "and good movement patterns."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:05:05",
  "text": "Also, compared to other areas,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:05:08",
  "text": "rear delts are harder to feel."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:05:10",
  "text": "So it’s even more important to train them with light weight."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:05:13",
  "text": "Last exercise—bicep curl."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:05:16",
  "text": "This is a muscle group most people can activate easily."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:05:18",
  "text": "In daily life, lots of movements involve the biceps."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:05:21",
  "text": "And in the gym,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:05:22",
  "text": "the most common equipment is this curl machine."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:05:25",
  "text": "Set your arms in position, then find a comfortable setup—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:05:28",
  "text": "then start with a warm-up set"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:05:29",
  "text": "before moving into working sets."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:05:30",
  "text": "Training tempo—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:05:31",
  "text": "slow lift, pause, slow release."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:05:34",
  "text": "And don’t go all the way down."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:05:35",
  "text": "For this movement, my working sets are"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:05:37",
  "text": "31.5 kg, 12 reps, 3 sets."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:05:39",
  "text": "Rest 90 seconds between sets."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:05:40",
  "text": "When training biceps—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:05:42",
  "text": "if you’re flying off the pad during the concentric phase,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:05:45",
  "text": "using leverage to pull the weight,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:05:46",
  "text": "then the weight is too heavy for you."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:05:48",
  "text": "Lower the weight—good movement patterns are key."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:05:52",
  "text": "When you finish training today,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:05:53",
  "text": "and you’re already looking forward to the next session—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:05:55",
  "text": "that’s a very healthy mindset."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:05:57",
  "text": "Fitness is this."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:05:58",
  "text": "Whether you’re in a good mood,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:05:59",
  "text": "or feeling down emotionally—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:06:01",
  "text": "if you can still show up and train,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:06:03",
  "text": "you’ve already succeeded."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:06:04",
  "text": "Fitness is a lifestyle habit."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:06:06",
  "text": "You don’t need to go all out every time you enter the gym,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:06:08",
  "text": "pushing yourself into days of delayed soreness"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:06:10",
  "text": "just to feel like you hit your goal."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:06:12",
  "text": "Sure, after heavy, high-intensity training,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:06:14",
  "text": "you’ll feel accomplished—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:06:16",
  "text": "and happy."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:06:17",
  "text": "But ask yourself—can you train like this"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:06:19",
  "text": "four days a week, for months on end?"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:06:22",
  "text": "So for beginners,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:06:23",
  "text": "I actually recommend not pushing intensity too high."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:06:25",
  "text": "Instead, focus on"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:06:27",
  "text": "making progress with every session."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:06:29",
  "text": "It doesn’t have to be heavier weight—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:06:30",
  "text": "your form improves,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:06:31",
  "text": "your neural recruitment gets better,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:06:33",
  "text": "your muscle activation feels stronger—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:06:34",
  "text": "all of that is progress."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:06:35",
  "text": "Finishing each workout feeling happy,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:06:38",
  "text": "and excited for the next one is what matters most."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:06:40",
  "text": "Welcome to day two of training—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:06:42",
  "text": "Leg day."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:06:43",
  "text": "A lot of people tend to skip leg day."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:06:45",
  "text": "Always thinking..."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:06:46",
  "text": "Big upper body is enough."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:06:48",
  "text": "Especially guys."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:06:49",
  "text": "But leg day—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:06:49",
  "text": "is super important for quality of life and body proportions."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:06:52",
  "text": "It really matters."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:06:53",
  "text": "First movement: leg press."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:06:55",
  "text": "You can use a leg press machine,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:06:56",
  "text": "or something like a hack squat machine."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:06:58",
  "text": "The main difference is—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:06:59",
  "text": "how much core engagement is required."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:07:01",
  "text": "Personally, I highly recommend the hack squat."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:07:03",
  "text": "But today I’ll demo the leg press machine—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:07:04",
  "text": "since it’s common and easy to use."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:07:06",
  "text": "It mainly trains"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:07:07",
  "text": "the quads, glutes, hamstrings, and calves."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:07:10",
  "text": "Depending on foot placement,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:07:12",
  "text": "you’ll target different areas."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:07:14",
  "text": "The higher you place your feet,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:07:14",
  "text": "the more glutes and hamstrings get involved."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:07:17",
  "text": "The lower you place them,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:07:18",
  "text": "the more load goes to your quads—front of the thighs."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:07:20",
  "text": "Wider stance activates more adductors."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:07:23",
  "text": "At the beginning, don’t overthink it."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:07:25",
  "text": "Just find a comfortable distance—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:07:27",
  "text": "not too high, not too low."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:07:28",
  "text": "At the bottom of the movement,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:07:29",
  "text": "your knees should be slightly below your toes."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:07:31",
  "text": "Feet slightly turned out."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:07:33",
  "text": "Knees follow the direction of your toes."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:07:35",
  "text": "When training on the leg press,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:07:36",
  "text": "there are two key things to watch out for."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:07:39",
  "text": "First—keep your lower back flat against the pad."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:07:41",
  "text": "If the weight is too heavy and your back arches,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:07:44",
  "text": "it can put pressure on your spine."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:07:46",
  "text": "Second—when pushing up,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:07:47",
  "text": "don’t lock your knees completely straight."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:07:49",
  "text": "Keep a slight bend to maintain muscle tension—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:07:51",
  "text": "and protect your knee joints."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:07:53",
  "text": "For this movement, I do"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:07:54",
  "text": "140 kg, 12 reps, 3 sets."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:07:56",
  "text": "Rest 90 seconds between sets."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:07:58",
  "text": "Training tempo: slow press, slow release."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:08:02",
  "text": "Coordinate with breathing—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:08:03",
  "text": "exhale slowly when pushing,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:08:05",
  "text": "inhale deeply when lowering."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:08:07",
  "text": "Second movement: leg curl machine."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:08:09",
  "text": "This strengthens your hamstrings—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:08:11",
  "text": "especially the biceps femoris."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:08:12",
  "text": "There are seated and prone versions."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:08:14",
  "text": "I highly recommend the prone version."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:08:16",
  "text": "It allows your body to stay"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:08:18",
  "text": "relaxed and stable,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:08:19",
  "text": "so you can focus on hamstring activation."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:08:21",
  "text": "Training tempo: slow curl, slow release."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:08:25",
  "text": "When curling, let the pad touch the back of your thighs,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:08:27",
  "text": "then slowly lower."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:08:29",
  "text": "For this movement, I use"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:08:30",
  "text": "42.5 kg, 12 reps, 3 sets."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:08:32",
  "text": "Rest 90 seconds between sets."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:08:34",
  "text": "Pay attention to my range and tempo—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:08:37",
  "text": "no need to rush."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:08:38",
  "text": "Move slowly and steadily through the full range."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:08:40",
  "text": "If you can’t complete the range,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:08:41",
  "text": "lower the weight."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:08:44",
  "text": "Final exercise: leg extension machine."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:08:46",
  "text": "This trains the front thigh muscles."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:08:48",
  "text": "Sit down and stabilize."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:08:49",
  "text": "Adjust the machine height."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:08:50",
  "text": "Keep your hamstrings and back pressed against the pad."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:08:53",
  "text": "Extend your legs upward, then slowly lower."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:08:56",
  "text": "This movement puts more pressure on the knees,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:08:58",
  "text": "so don’t go too heavy."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:09:00",
  "text": "Focus on a stable tempo,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:09:02",
  "text": "and feel the stretch in your quads."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:09:03",
  "text": "Training tempo—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:09:04",
  "text": "slow lift, pause, slow release."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:09:07",
  "text": "For this movement, I use"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:09:08",
  "text": "72.5 kg, 12 reps, 3 sets."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:09:10",
  "text": "Rest 90 seconds between sets."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:09:12",
  "text": "That wraps up two days of training."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:09:14",
  "text": "To improve results,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:09:15",
  "text": "training alone isn’t enough—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:09:16",
  "text": "recovery is just as important."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:09:18",
  "text": "Make sure you get enough protein every day."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:09:21",
  "text": "It helps your muscles recover."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:09:22",
  "text": "After each round of breakdown, rebuild—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:09:24",
  "text": "so your muscles"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:09:25",
  "text": "get stronger and stronger."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:09:26",
  "text": "Getting enough protein"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:09:27",
  "text": "helps with recovery,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:09:28",
  "text": "and ultimately—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:09:29",
  "text": "helps improve your physique."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:09:31",
  "text": "Phargoods is currently offering"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:09:32",
  "text": "soy protein powder."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:09:33",
  "text": "Sourced from the U.S., 100% plant-based."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:09:35",
  "text": "High satiety, low allergy risk."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:09:37",
  "text": "More stable insulin response."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:09:39",
  "text": "Suitable for vegans, vegetarians, lactose intolerant,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:09:41",
  "text": "or anyone avoiding animal products."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:09:43",
  "text": "I drink it in the morning and post-workout"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:09:45",
  "text": "to meet my daily protein needs."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:09:47",
  "text": "During the launch period,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:09:49",
  "text": "click the pinned comment link"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:09:50",
  "text": "and you'll get..."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:09:51",
  "text": "a 21% discount bundle!"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:09:52",
  "text": "Only 300 sets available—much cheaper than the official site."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:09:55",
  "text": "Personally, I recommend the original, cocoa, and oat flavors—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:09:57",
  "text": "a combo that satisfies all three at once."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:09:59",
  "text": "Take it alongside this video"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:10:01",
  "text": "to help build muscle and burn fat—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:10:03",
  "text": "for maximum results."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:10:04",
  "text": "I’ll leave the link in the video description"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:10:06",
  "text": "and the pinned comment section."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:10:07",
  "text": "Thanks for your support!"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:10:10",
  "text": "Now it’s day three—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:10:11",
  "text": "Shoulder day."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:10:12",
  "text": "Shoulders are widely considered"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:10:14",
  "text": "the highest bang-for-buck muscle group."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:10:15",
  "text": "If you’ve got thick, broad shoulders,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:10:17",
  "text": "your overall proportions will look super balanced."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:10:20",
  "text": "Visually, it also makes"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:10:21",
  "text": "your waist look smaller,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:10:22",
  "text": "and your head look smaller."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:10:23",
  "text": "First movement—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:10:24",
  "text": "Seated shoulder press."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:10:25",
  "text": "You can use any shoulder press machine at the gym,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:10:28",
  "text": "or use the Smith machine."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:10:29",
  "text": "Personally, I prefer the Smith machine—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:10:31",
  "text": "but it does require a few extra setup steps."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:10:34",
  "text": "So today I’ll demo with the shoulder press machine."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:10:36",
  "text": "Super simple, same great effect."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:10:37",
  "text": "Just adjust the seat height properly."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:10:40",
  "text": "At the bottom of the movement,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:10:41",
  "text": "your elbows should be slightly below shoulder level."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:10:43",
  "text": "If the handles are too low, the pressing angle becomes awkward—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:10:46",
  "text": "and increases shoulder joint pressure."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:10:47",
  "text": "Inhale, brace your core, and press upward."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:10:50",
  "text": "Exhale slowly during the movement."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:10:52",
  "text": "Try to keep your back pressed against the seat."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:10:55",
  "text": "This movement mainly targets the anterior delts,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:10:58",
  "text": "but also works the lateral delts and triceps."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:11:02",
  "text": "If your elbows flare out too much,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:11:04",
  "text": "it may increase shoulder impingement."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:11:05",
  "text": "So during training,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:11:06",
  "text": "try moving your elbows slightly forward."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:11:09",
  "text": "At the top of the press,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:11:10",
  "text": "don’t fully lock out your elbows,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:11:12",
  "text": "and don’t completely release the weight."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:11:15",
  "text": "Keep tension on the shoulders throughout the movement."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:11:18",
  "text": "Slow press, slow release."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:11:21",
  "text": "For this movement, I use"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:11:22",
  "text": "50 kg per side, 12 reps, 3 sets."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:11:24",
  "text": "Rest 90 seconds between sets."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:11:27",
  "text": "Second movement—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:11:27",
  "text": "Machine lateral raise."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:11:29",
  "text": "We’re using the most common,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:11:30",
  "text": "standard lateral raise machine."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:11:32",
  "text": "It’s great for isolating the lateral delts,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:11:35",
  "text": "sculpting shoulder width,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:11:37",
  "text": "and building that V-taper look(wide shoulders, narrow waist)."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:11:38",
  "text": "Adjust the seat height"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:11:40",
  "text": "so the pads sit roughly"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:11:41",
  "text": "on your upper arm near the elbow."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:11:43",
  "text": "While performing,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:11:44",
  "text": "watch out for overcompensation from your traps."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:11:47",
  "text": "You can lean forward slightly—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:11:49",
  "text": "then raise your elbows forward and outward."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:11:52",
  "text": "Remember: it’s an outward and upward arc,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:11:54",
  "text": "not a straight lift."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:11:56",
  "text": "The easiest way to check—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:11:58",
  "text": "see if you’re shrugging during the movement."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:12:00",
  "text": "Compare both forms side by side."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:12:03",
  "text": "For pacing, I go with:"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:12:04",
  "text": "slow lift, pause, slow release."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:12:07",
  "text": "Avoid explosive thrusts—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:12:09",
  "text": "stay controlled and steady."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:12:11",
  "text": "Feel the weight sitting firmly on your shoulders."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:12:14",
  "text": "For this movement, I use"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:12:15",
  "text": "32 kg, 12 reps, 3 sets."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:12:17",
  "text": "Rest 90 seconds between sets."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:12:18",
  "text": "Final movement—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:12:19",
  "text": "Cable pushdown."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:12:20",
  "text": "Targeting the triceps."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:12:22",
  "text": "Find a cable machine and a V-rope attachment."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:12:24",
  "text": "Adjust the height to about shoulder level."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:12:27",
  "text": "Use your body to help bring the rope down into position."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:12:29",
  "text": "You can stand staggered or feet parallel—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:12:32",
  "text": "just make sure your body stays stable and doesn’t swing."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:12:35",
  "text": "Your elbows should be the only pivot point."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:12:38",
  "text": "Keep your upper arms close to your body, elbows fixed."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:12:40",
  "text": "Try to keep the rope parallel to the machine’s cable"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:12:42",
  "text": "so the force line stays consistent."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:12:44",
  "text": "That way, you can check if your form is consistent."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:12:47",
  "text": "Training rhythm: slow press, pause, slow release."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:12:50",
  "text": "For this movement, I use"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:12:51",
  "text": "20 kg, 12 reps, 3 sets."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:12:53",
  "text": "Rest 90 seconds between sets."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:12:56",
  "text": "Now we’re on day four—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:12:57",
  "text": "Back day."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:12:58",
  "text": "Training your back has tons of benefits."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:12:59",
  "text": "It improves posture,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:13:01",
  "text": "and also helps with"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:13:02",
  "text": "daily function and athletic performance."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:13:04",
  "text": "Today we’ll do"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:13:05",
  "text": "two vertical pulls and one horizontal pull—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:13:07",
  "text": "all using the cable machine."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:13:08",
  "text": "Super simple."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:13:10",
  "text": "First movement—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:13:10",
  "text": "Overhand lat pulldown."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:13:12",
  "text": "A classic back training exercise."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:13:14",
  "text": "Grip wider than shoulder width—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:13:15",
  "text": "about 1.5 times your shoulder width."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:13:17",
  "text": "Palms facing forward."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:13:18",
  "text": "Use your body to help bring the bar down into position,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:13:20",
  "text": "and lock your legs under the thigh pads."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:13:23",
  "text": "During training,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:13:24",
  "text": "scapular and torso stability are key."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:13:26",
  "text": "As you pull down, let your scapula naturally depress."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:13:29",
  "text": "Pull the bar down to your upper chest or collarbone."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:13:32",
  "text": "Squeeze your scapula inward,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:13:33",
  "text": "and feel your back muscles contract."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:13:35",
  "text": "Lean back slightly, then return upright."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:13:37",
  "text": "No need to over-control your torso angle."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:13:39",
  "text": "You can practice scapular control with just bodyweight."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:13:42",
  "text": "Raise both arms overhead."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:13:43",
  "text": "Relax your scapula."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:13:45",
  "text": "Then depress your scapula."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:13:47",
  "text": "Relax, then squeeze downward."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:13:50",
  "text": "That’s exactly what you want during training."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:13:53",
  "text": "Training tempo: slow pull, pause, slow release."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:13:56",
  "text": "Control the movement—don’t bounce."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:13:58",
  "text": "Compare both forms side by side."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:14:00",
  "text": "Keep control when releasing the bar."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:14:02",
  "text": "No need to fully extend your arms—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:14:04",
  "text": "keep tension on your back."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:14:05",
  "text": "If your body swings too much,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:14:07",
  "text": "using momentum to pull—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:14:08",
  "text": "you might lift heavier,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:14:09",
  "text": "but it won’t be as effective as slow, controlled reps."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:14:12",
  "text": "For this movement, I use"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:14:13",
  "text": "63 kg, 12 reps, 3 sets."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:14:15",
  "text": "Rest 90 seconds between sets."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:14:18",
  "text": "Second movement—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:14:19",
  "text": "Underhand lat pulldown."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:14:20",
  "text": "You can use the same cable machine,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:14:22",
  "text": "or an underhand lat pulldown station for more lat focus."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:14:26",
  "text": "Grip slightly narrower than shoulder width."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:14:27",
  "text": "Keep your chest up and scapula engaged."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:14:29",
  "text": "Lift your chest slightly."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:14:31",
  "text": "Maintain a natural curve in your back."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:14:32",
  "text": "As you pull down, let your scapula naturally depress."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:14:35",
  "text": "Then activate your back muscles."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:14:36",
  "text": "Avoid shrugging or pulling with your arms."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:14:39",
  "text": "Training tempo: slow pull, pause, slow release."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:14:43",
  "text": "Avoid bouncing or using momentum to lift."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:14:46",
  "text": "For this movement, I use"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:14:46",
  "text": "56 kg, 12 reps, 3 sets."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:14:48",
  "text": "Rest 90 seconds between sets."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:14:50",
  "text": "Final movement—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:14:51",
  "text": "Seated row."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:14:53",
  "text": "Because of the movement path,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:14:54",
  "text": "both vertical and horizontal pulls"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:14:56",
  "text": "train the back muscles—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:14:58",
  "text": "but horizontal pulls help build thickness."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:15:00",
  "text": "They activate more rhomboids and traps."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:15:03",
  "text": "You can use a cable or rowing machine."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:15:06",
  "text": "Feet on the pedals, knees slightly bent."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:15:08",
  "text": "Keep your lower back straight and chest up."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:15:10",
  "text": "Let your back stay natural."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:15:12",
  "text": "Avoid hunching or shrugging."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:15:13",
  "text": "One special thing about this movement—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:15:16",
  "text": "narrow grip and wide grip target different muscles."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:15:19",
  "text": "I recommend starting with lighter weight and wide grip rows—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:15:22",
  "text": "to stimulate and strengthen"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:15:23",
  "text": "your upper back, traps, and rhomboids."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:15:26",
  "text": "Training tempo: slow pull, pause, slow release."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:15:29",
  "text": "Don’t fully relax on the release—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:15:31",
  "text": "avoid leaning forward and using momentum to restart."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:15:34",
  "text": "For this movement, I use"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:15:35",
  "text": "49 kg, 12 reps, 3 sets."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:15:37",
  "text": "Rest 90 seconds between sets."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:15:39",
  "text": "That wraps up the full routine—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:15:41",
  "text": "a beginner-friendly, machine-based workout plan."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:15:43",
  "text": "4 days, 13 exercises, full-body training."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:15:46",
  "text": "This machine-based program"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:15:47",
  "text": "is just a general framework."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:15:49",
  "text": "Meaning—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:15:49",
  "text": "if you focus on mastering these 13 movements,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:15:51",
  "text": "you’ll see noticeable improvements in your physique"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:15:54",
  "text": "You may have noticed—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:15:55",
  "text": "every movement is 12 reps, 3 sets,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:15:57",
  "text": "with 90 seconds rest."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:15:58",
  "text": "Training tempo—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:15:58",
  "text": "slow, pause, slow release."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:16:01",
  "text": "This isn’t a strict rule—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:16:02",
  "text": "it’s just"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:16:02",
  "text": "a general guideline."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:16:03",
  "text": "Once you’ve made progress,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:16:05",
  "text": "and built solid movement patterns,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:16:07",
  "text": "you can gradually add in"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:16:08",
  "text": "heavy low-rep sets,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:16:09",
  "text": "or high-rep endurance sets."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:16:11",
  "text": "In short, my goal is—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:16:12",
  "text": "to help beginners who want to start training at the gym"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:16:14",
  "text": "do it in the simplest and safest way possible."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:16:17",
  "text": "No need to memorize too much."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:16:18",
  "text": "Just spend an hour each time,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:16:20",
  "text": "and focus on doing 3–4 movements well."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:16:22",
  "text": "Once you’re familiar with everything,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:16:23",
  "text": "you can gradually add in"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:16:24",
  "text": "free weight exercises."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:16:26",
  "text": "In the next video,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:16:27",
  "text": "I’ll release a full-body free weight workout."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:16:29",
  "text": "To help you train more completely."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:16:31",
  "text": "And lastly, remember—"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:16:32",
  "text": "the video description and pinned comment section"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:16:34",
  "text": "have the link to buy soy protein powder."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:16:36",
  "text": "Pair it with this video,"
 },
 {
  "t": "00:16:37",
  "text": "and let Guy help you build muscle successfully."
 },
 {
  "t": "00:16:39",
  "text": "See you next workout—bye bye!"
 }
